{"4629920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Backrooms: Echo", "steam_appid": 4629920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/bb76697b37cb4ef7e2f44cbca0bbabb4.webp?t=1780880558\" width=101 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Backrooms alone or in a team of up to four players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s your call — stick together or split up to find the exit faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: the farther apart you are, the harder it is to help each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/a5f2dcb8f95a51be0a1a656d80d49803.poster.avif?t=1780880558\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/a5f2dcb8f95a51be0a1a656d80d49803.webm?t=1780880558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/a5f2dcb8f95a51be0a1a656d80d49803.mp4?t=1780880558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/d10c654705669546d310c668ee1ff36e.webp?t=1780880558\" width=160 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone here. Every level is inhabited by entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe, hide, adapt. There may be no second chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/0d6e8f510d0f8c5bdbce76bf2bbadbfc.poster.avif?t=1780880558\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/0d6e8f510d0f8c5bdbce76bf2bbadbfc.webm?t=1780880558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/0d6e8f510d0f8c5bdbce76bf2bbadbfc.mp4?t=1780880558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/f7521d34d63c52db33bc7c2ac5eef3ef.webp?t=1780880558\" width=140 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic lighting and graphics powered by Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth, natural character movement. Detailed procedurally generated environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Backrooms have never felt this real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/e5369d2de59f723834709b8ac4535893.poster.avif?t=1780880558\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/e5369d2de59f723834709b8ac4535893.webm?t=1780880558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/e5369d2de59f723834709b8ac4535893.mp4?t=1780880558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/4960e01dd70be20b2c614f9672b1ed8a.webp?t=1780880558\" width=418 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorizing the path is useless — the Backrooms shift. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are regenerated with every run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activities are placed randomly, and you must complete them to progress further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/6fd4fccc421b990c32aad8bcedc7eb31.poster.avif?t=1780880558\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/6fd4fccc421b990c32aad8bcedc7eb31.webm?t=1780880558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/6fd4fccc421b990c32aad8bcedc7eb31.mp4?t=1780880558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/9349632760c8f2e9ef359f3a7cf6472a.webp?t=1780880558\" width=200 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with your teammates through proximity-based voice chat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But stay alert: the voice of your friend in the next corridor might not be theirs.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629920/extras/bb76697b37cb4ef7e2f44cbca0bbabb4.webp?t=1780880558\" width=101 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Backrooms alone or in a team of up to four players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s your call — stick together or split up to find the exit faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: the farther apart you are, the harder it is to help each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a